  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **ween2007-06-16.dpa4023v3722** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 118 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: This dpa4023v3722 version is judged a better recording of the show than the other circulating one [8]\n- **ween2007-06-16.flac**: source not stated; 24 songs; 117 min; rated 3.33/5 by 6 [2]. Said about its sound: Reviewer found the recording poor, though the concert itself was good; Recording quality is mediocre and could be better [7][9]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Gene and Dean seemed engaged and into the performance [3]\n- Reviewer meant to split time with Franz Ferdinand but stayed at the Ween tent for nearly the whole set [5]\n- Reviewer happened to be resting near the stage, and noted the crowd's eccentric, freaky people [9]\n- Reviewer had just seen Ween in Asheville and found that show far crazier than this Bonnaroo set [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2007-06-16.dpa4023v3722**: taped by shane sheffield; transferred by shane sheffield; source: dpa4023's>v3>722@24/96 [1]\n- **ween2007-06-16.flac**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: FOB Schoeps mk41 (ORTF) > kc5 > cmc6 > Lunatec V2 > Sound Devices 702@24/48 [2]",
